  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline Wasabi X is an ultra-slick round co-polyester designed primarily as a hybrid cross string. Its low-friction surface allows shaped or textured main strings to slide and snap back more freely, increasing string movement, spin efficiency and response consistency. The round geometry also creates a cleaner and more predictable launch angle while producing strong pocketing, explosive pop, easy depth and improved court penetration. Wasabi X is available in Neon Blue at 1.23 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline Wasabi X 是一款主要针对 Hybrid 横线设计的超光滑圆形共聚酯球线。其低摩擦表面能够让异形或纹理主线更自由地滑动并快速 Snapback，从而提升主线移动、旋转效率和线床响应一致性。圆形结构同时带来更干净、更可预测的 Launch Angle，并提供优秀的 Pocketing、爆发性 Pop、轻松深度以及更强的 Court Penetration。产品采用 Neon Blue 配色，规格为 1.23 毫米 / 17。"
  },

